# Let me implement a basic CSS selector. I'll support:
# - element type selectors: div, p, span
# - class selectors: .class
# - id selectors: #id
# - compound: div.class, div#id
# - descendant: div p
# - child: div > p
# - attribute: [attr], [attr=value], [attr*=value]
# - comma-separated: a, b

# Now let me write the full implementation
